JubilifeCity_Text_Man1:
	.string "JUBILIFE is Sinnoh's biggest city!\n"
	.string "There's something new around every\l"
	.string "corner.$"

JubilifeCity_Text_Woman1:
	.string "The TRAINERS' SCHOOL is right next\n"
	.string "to the POKéMON CENTER. It's a\l"
	.string "great place to learn!$"

JubilifeCity_Text_Kid1:
	.string "Have you seen the POKéTCH? It's a\n"
	.string "watch made just for Trainers!$"

JubilifeCity_Text_Gentleman:
	.string "JUBILIFE TV broadcasts news from\n"
	.string "all over the region. Very\l"
	.string "informative.$"

JubilifeCity_Text_Lass:
	.string "I heard there's a GYM in OREBURGH,\n"
	.string "east of here. The leader uses\l"
	.string "ROCK-types.$"

JubilifeCity_Text_Man2:
	.string "People in odd outfits were\n"
	.string "bothering folks near the edge of\l"
	.string "town. Strange...$"

JubilifeCity_EventScript_Sign1::
	msgbox JubilifeCity_Text_Sign1, MSGBOX_SIGN
	end

JubilifeCity_Text_Sign1:
	.string "JUBILIFE CITY\p"
	.string "The most modern city in Sinnoh.$"

JubilifeCity_EventScript_Sign2::
